# ============================================================
# plan: laco_vent -- vent the LACO chamber to atmosphere
# ============================================================
# Guards first: platen and shroud inside the vent window (10-60 C on the
# shipped profile); each guard fails the plan if not met within 30 s. Then the
# vent valve opens (the PLC needs the rough and gate valves closed) and the plan
# waits for atmosphere. The valve is left open, as the HMI leaves it; close it
# with `hvc vent close` before the next pumpdown.
#
# Typical: 4.4 -> 743 Torr in about 40 s (2026-10-01).

load rLACO
record every 2 s

until platenT above 10 C timeout 30 s
until platenT below 60 C timeout 30 s
until shroudT above 10 C timeout 30 s
until shroudT below 60 C timeout 30 s
hvc vent open
until chamberP above 700 timeout 10 min
log vented; vent valve left open
